                      {
                          "question":  "What are the unique features of ProposalForce\u0027s competitor products?",
                          "ground_truth":  "QuoteMaster Pro offers AI-driven proposal customization using industry-specific templates, integrates with major CRM systems for seamless data import, has real-time collaboration tools for team input and feedback, and provides automated follow-up reminders and tracking.\n\nSalesPitch Genie offers several unique features: a drag-and-drop interface for easy proposal creation, real-time collaboration allowing multiple users to work on a proposal simultaneously, a customizable analytics dashboard providing insights into proposal views and client interactions, a mobile app for on-the-go proposal management, and a library of industry-specific pre-designed proposal templates.\n\nPropelQuote offers automated quote generation with dynamic pricing adjustments, integrates with popular payment gateways for instant transactions, provides custom branding options for personalized proposals, and offers 24/7 customer support with live chat.",
