                      {
                          "question":  "What are the weaknesses of ProposalForce\u0027s competitor products?",
                          "ground_truth":  "The weaknesses of QuoteMaster Pro include limited language support beyond English, which could be a barrier for international users, and higher pricing for advanced features, which are about 20-30% above the industry average. These factors might deter cost-sensitive customers and users in non-English speaking regions.\n\nThe weaknesses of SalesPitch Genie include a lack of advanced customization options in the basic version, such as limited ability to customize templates, modify layouts, and integrate third-party tools. Additionally, there are occasional syncing issues with their mobile app, leading to delays in data syncing between the desktop and mobile app.\n\nPropelQuote has a steep learning curve for new users due to a non-intuitive interface and a lack of comprehensive onboarding resources. Additionally, their third-party integrations are limited, supporting only basic tools like email and calendar apps, and missing more advanced tools like CRM systems and analytics platforms. These weaknesses could lead to user frustration and impact customer retention.",
